{
  "name": "anvils",
  "normalizations": [
    "With 30 levels at an anvil: repair a worn diamond sword with diamonds, combine an iron sword with an enchanted book (one enchantment upgraded, one added), combine two worn diamond swords, and offer an iron sword a book of an enchantment exclusive with its own.",
    "Compare the result offered and the inventory after shift-clicking it out and closing the anvil: durability, enchantments, repair cost and what is left of the inputs. Whether the anvil wears down is random, so it is replaced before each use.",
    "Use matching flat terrain with natural spawning off."
